<title>USA: Imagyn sees Q2 revs not exceeding Q1.</title>
<headline>Imagyn sees Q2 revs not exceeding Q1.</headline>
<dateline>LAGUNA NIGUEL 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imagyn Medical Inc said it does not anticipate that total revenue for the second quarter ending June 30, 1997, will exceed its total revenue of $818,000, for the quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>For the first quarter, Imagyn reported a net loss of $1,794,000, or $0.21 cents per share, versus a net loss of $1,569,000, or $0.29 cents per share a year earlier.</p>
</text>
